}</style>
</head>
<body class="luma-page" style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f4f4f2;color:#1a1a1a;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%">
<div style="display:none;font-size:1px;color:#f4f4f2;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden">Vi følger med på nye kunngjøringer på Doffin og sender deg treff som passer kriteriene dine.</div>
<table role="presentation" class="luma-page" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;background-color:#f4f4f2">
<tr>
<td align="center" style="padding:20px 12px">
<table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;text-align:left">
<tr>
<td>
<!--luma:section:header-->
<p class="luma-text" style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#1a1a1a"><strong>Luma Anbudsvarsling</strong></p>
<p class="luma-muted" style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#5b5b57">En gratis tjeneste fra Luma Training</p>
<!--luma:section:title-->
<h1 class="luma-text" style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#1a1a1a">Varslingsprofilen er aktiv</h1>
<p class="luma-muted" style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#5b5b57">12. mars 2026</p>
<p class="luma-text" style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#1a1a1a">Vi følger med på nye kunngjøringer på Doffin og sender deg treff som passer kriteriene dine.</p>
<h3 class="luma-text" style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#1a1a1a">Kriteriene dine</h3>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:10px"><tr><td style="padding:2px 12px 2px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#5b5b57;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap" class="luma-muted">CPV-koder</td><td style="padding:2px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#1a1a1a;vertical-align:top" class="luma-text">45214210, 45331000, 45422100</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 12px 2px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#5b5b57;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap" class="luma-muted">Søkeord</td><td style="padding:2px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#1a1a1a;vertical-align:top" class="luma-text">rehabilitering, tømrer, skole</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 12px 2px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#5b5b57;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap" class="luma-muted">Geografi</td><td style="padding:2px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#1a1a1a;vertical-align:top" class="luma-text">NO081, NO082</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 12px 2px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#5b5b57;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap" class="luma-muted">Oppdragsgivere</td><td style="padding:2px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#1a1a1a;vertical-align:top" class="luma-text">Ingen</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 12px 2px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#5b5b57;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap" class="luma-muted">Verdiintervall</td><td style="padding:2px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#1a1a1a;vertical-align:top" class="luma-text">2 000 000–60 000 000 NOK</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 12px 2px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#5b5b57;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap" class="luma-muted">Planlagte anskaffelser</td><td style="padding:2px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#1a1a1a;vertical-align:top" class="luma-text">Inkludert</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 12px 2px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#5b5b57;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap" class="luma-muted">Varslingsfrekvens</td><td style="padding:2px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#1a1a1a;vertical-align:top" class="luma-text">Daglig sammendrag</td></tr></table>
<p class="luma-text" style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#1a1a1a"><a class="luma-link" href="https://anbudsvarsling.luma-training.com/varsler?utm_source=anbudsvarsling&amp;utm_medium=digest" style="color:#1c4b8c;text-decoration:underline">Se varslingsprofilen</a></p>
<p class="luma-muted" style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#5b5b57">Vi rangerer anbud etter hvor godt de passer varslingsprofilen din. Kurs, annonser eller kommersielle hensyn påvirker aldri hvilke anbud du får se.</p>
<p class="luma-muted" style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#5b5b57">Tjenesten dekker kunngjøringer publisert på Doffin. Anskaffelser under terskelverdiene publiseres ikke alltid der, og spørsmål og svar i konkurranser skjer i oppdragsgivers konkurranseverktøy. Følg derfor alltid konkurransens egne kanaler når du jobber med et anbud. At du ikke får varsel, betyr ikke at det ikke finnes muligheter.</p>
<!--luma:section:profile-admin-->
<h3 class="luma-text" style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#1a1a1a">Profiladministrasjon</h3>
<ul style="margin:0 0 12px 0;padding-left:20px"><li class="luma-text" style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:4px"><a class="luma-link" href="https://anbudsvarsling.luma-training.com/varsler?utm_source=anbudsvarsling&amp;utm_medium=digest" style="color:#1c4b8c;text-decoration:underline">Administrer varslingsprofil</a></li><li class="luma-text" style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:4px"><a class="luma-link" href="https://anbudsvarsling.luma-training.com/innstillinger?handling=pause-varsler&amp;t=tok_7d1f2b6c9a&amp;utm_source=anbudsvarsling&amp;utm_medium=digest" style="color:#1c4b8c;text-decoration:underline">Pause varsler</a></li></ul>
<!--luma:section:notification-settings-->
<h3 class="luma-text" style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#1a1a1a">Varslingsinnstillinger</h3>
<ul style="margin:0 0 12px 0;padding-left:20px"><li class="luma-text" style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:4px"><a class="luma-link" href="https://anbudsvarsling.luma-training.com/innstillinger?utm_source=anbudsvarsling&amp;utm_medium=digest" style="color:#1c4b8c;text-decoration:underline">Varslingsinnstillinger</a></li><li class="luma-text" style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:4px"><a class="luma-link" href="https://anbudsvarsling.luma-training.com/innstillinger?handling=slaa-av-promotering&amp;t=tok_7d1f2b6c9a&amp;utm_source=anbudsvarsling&amp;utm_medium=digest" style="color:#1c4b8c;text-decoration:underline">Luma-informasjon i anbudsvarslene</a></li><li class="luma-text" style="font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:4px"><a class="luma-link" href="https://anbudsvarsling.luma-training.com/innstillinger?handling=avslutt-anbudsvarsling&amp;t=tok_7d1f2b6c9a&amp;utm_source=anbudsvarsling&amp;utm_medium=digest" style="color:#1c4b8c;text-decoration:underline">Avslutt anbudsvarsling</a></li></ul>
<!--luma:section:legal-->
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%"><tr><td style="border-top:2px solid #c9c7bb;font-size:0;line-height:0;height:1px">&nbsp;</td></tr></table>
