<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%"><tr><td style="border-top:2px solid #c9c7bb;font-size:0;line-height:0;height:1px">&nbsp;</td></tr></table>
<h3 class="luma-text" style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#1a1a1a">Hvorfor mottar jeg denne e-posten?</h3>
<p class="luma-muted" style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#5b5b57">Du mottar denne e-posten fordi du har opprettet en varslingsprofil i Luma Anbudsvarsling.</p>
